<p>Taxis do pass along Calle Coso regularly, given its status as one of the busier streets in central Zaragoza, but hailing one during peak pedestrian hours or festival periods can still mean a wait, and a wait is the last thing you want with a flight to catch. A pre-booked private transfer removes that uncertainty entirely, with a car scheduled for your exact time and pickup point regardless of how busy the street happens to be that day.</p>
